From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CN MrLin <cnmrlin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 02:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Match square quickview buffers to HAL dimensions

The rear HAL copies a 1280x960 image into the early YUV buffer. Reading it as
1080x1080 produces striped thumbnails. Request 1280x960 and use the existing
1:1 crop in the app.

---
diff --git a/smali/e8/e0.smali b/smali/e8/e0.smali
--- a/smali/e8/e0.smali
+++ b/smali/e8/e0.smali
@@ -15907,6 +15907,25 @@
 
     move-result v0
 
+    iget-object v7, v2, Le8/e0$a;->a:Le8/e0;
+
+    iget v7, v7, Le8/a;->a:I
+
+    const/4 v8, 0x1
+
+    if-ne v7, v8, :early_size_ready
+
+    const/16 v8, 0x438
+
+    if-ne v1, v8, :early_size_ready
+
+    if-ne v0, v8, :early_size_ready
+
+    const/16 v1, 0x500
+
+    const/16 v0, 0x3c0
+
+    :early_size_ready
     iget p0, p0, Le8/P;->Y:I
 
     const/16 v6, 0x23

-- 
2.43.0
